d=\"ub4867c8d\" id=\"ub4867c8d\"> → “您的”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"u2e8b21c7\" id=\"u2e8b21c7\"><span data-lake-id=\"uda4a2ecc\" id=\"uda4a2ecc\">“您的” → “订单”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ud9271b61\" id=\"ud9271b61\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60d177ab\" id=\"u60d177ab\">“订单” → “正在”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ubd969548\" id=\"ubd969548\"><span data-lake-id=\"u89607ec0\" id=\"u89607ec0\">“正在” → “配送”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ua47a6845\" id=\"ua47a6845\"><span data-lake-id=\"u95efc8b0\" id=\"u95efc8b0\">“配送” → “中”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"uebad9ad0\" id=\"uebad9ad0\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3fbe32f1\" id=\"u3fbe32f1\">“中” → “，”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"u6b38c7e9\" id=\"u6b38c7e9\"><span data-lake-id=\"uaf81bde7\" id=\"uaf81bde7\">“，” → “预计”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ufc46e373\" id=\"ufc46e373\"><span data-lake-id=\"u920c8193\" id=\"u920c8193\">“预计” → “明天”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ub49280e2\" id=\"ub49280e2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucee4724b\" id=\"ucee4724b\">“明天” → “送达”</span></li><li fid=\"u11b13c47\" data-lake-id=\"ua0512a0c\" id=\"ua0512a0c\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf740987b\" id=\"uf740987b\">“送达” → </span><code data-lake-id=\"u811971a3\" id=\"u811971a3\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue13f5334\" id=\"ue13f5334\">&lt;/s&gt;</span></code></li></ol><ul list=\"ue1bbeb10\" start=\"3\" data-lake-indent=\"1\"><li fid=\"uce032e8b\" data-lake-id=\"u41b689f4\" id=\"u41b689f4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u950afb72\" id=\"u950afb72\">最终输出：“您的订单正在配送中，预计明天送达。”</span></li></ul><ol list=\"ue3463386\" start=\"4\"><li fid=\"ud1d733ba\" data-lake-id=\"ua0d61e2d\" id=\"ua0d61e2d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ufb3d8fcb\" id=\"ufb3d8fcb\">代码片段</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u56596c5b\" id=\"u56596c5b\">：</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22cod